# internal/ — private docs, research, plans, experiments (see CLAUDE.md).
# Ignore all contents but not the directory itself so exceptions can be added.
internal/**
# Exception: the public /claims/formal viewer imports this deterministic PCA
# artifact at build time. Contains structural metadata only (claim IDs,
# topics, outcomes, 3D coords, depends_on edges) — no scientific numbers.
!internal/InSilico/
!internal/InSilico/projection/
!internal/InSilico/projection/formal_claim_projection_v1.json

